      "content": "It is incredibly heavy to feel so hopeless when you see the disconnect between the end of the world and the pressure to \"pretend.\" You don't have to force yourself to hope or rationalize away the despair you feel right now. Please try to take a step back from the constant doom on the news and seek support from a medical professional who can help you manage these intense feelings without pressure.",
      "source": "target",
